    {
      "id": "r1",
      "kind": "recap",
      "body": "A difference of squares splits into a sum times a difference.",
      "takeaways": [
        "a² − b² = (a + b)(a − b) — no middle term.",
        "Coefficients can be squares too: 4x² = (2x)².",
        "A sum of squares (a² + b²) does not factor this way."
      ],
